       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.

       PROGRAM-ID.     CGENARIB.
       AUTHOR.         EXLTECH, INC - DAN RAUCH

      ***************************************************************
      **     THIS SUBROUTINE RETRIEVES THE NEXT ARIBA PO NUMBER
      ***************************************************************

      *================================================================
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
      *===============================================================

       CONFIGURATION SECTION.

       SOURCE-COMPUTER.       IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.       IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.         LOCAL-DATA IS PONUMDA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT PLANT-INFO-FILE   ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.

           SELECT MPORCV-FILE       ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.

      *================================================================
       DATA DIVISION.
      *================================================================
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  PLANT-INFO-FILE.
       01  PLANT-INFO-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS0501.
       COPY MPLTINFO IN COPYLIB.
       COPY MPLTARPO IN COPYLIB.

       FD  MPORCV-FILE.
       01  MPORCV-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS0101.
       COPY MPORCV   IN COPYLIB.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY FILESTATUS IN COPYLIB.

      *****************************************************************
      *  PO NUMBER DATA AREA
      *****************************************************************
       01  WS-PO-NUMBER-AREA.
           03  WS-PO-NUMBER-A     PIC X(07)    VALUE SPACE.
           03  WS-PO-NUMBER-R1  REDEFINES WS-PO-NUMBER-A.
               05  WS-PO-NUMBER-N PIC 9(07).
           03  WS-PO-NUMBER-R2  REDEFINES WS-PO-NUMBER-A.
               05  WS-PO-N1A      PIC X(01).
               05  WS-PO-N2-7N    PIC 9(06).
               05  WS-PO-N2-7A  REDEFINES WS-PO-N2-7N PIC X(06).
           03  WS-PO-NUMBER-R3  REDEFINES WS-PO-NUMBER-A.
               05  FILLER         PIC X(01).
               05  WS-PO-N2A      PIC X(01).
               05  WS-PO-N3-7N    PIC 9(05).
               05  WS-PO-N3-7A  REDEFINES WS-PO-N3-7N PIC X(05).

      *================================================================
      *  NEW PO NUMBER RETURNED TO CALLING PROGRAM
      *  POSITION  1 ALWAYS  ===> 'P'
      *  POSITION  2 THRU 8  ===>  LAST PO NUM FROM PLANT INF0 + 1
      *  POSITION  9 THRU 14 ===>  '000000'
      *================================================================
           03  WS-NEW-PO-NUMBER.
               05  FILLER         PIC X(01)           VALUE "P".
               05  WS-NEW-PO-NUM  PIC X(07)           VALUE SPACE.
               05  FILLER         PIC X(06)           VALUE "000000".

      *****************************************************************
      *  ERROR MESSAGES
      *****************************************************************
       01  WS-ERROR-MESSAGES.
           03  WS-PLTNOF-MSG      PIC X(80)    VALUE
               "CGENARIB - ARPO PLANT INFO RECORD NOT FOUND".

           03  WS-INVALID-MSG1   PIC X(80)    VALUE
               "CGENARIB - PLANT INFO LAST PO NUMBER INVALID".

      *****************************************************************
      *  MISCELLAEOUS WORK FIELDS
      *****************************************************************
       01  WS-MISCELLANEOUS-WORK-FLDS.
           03  WS-PLTINFO-KEY     PIC X(04)    VALUE "ARPO".


      *================================================================
      *===             L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N
      *================================================================
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LS-NEXT-PO-NUMBER          PIC X(14).
       01  LS-ERROR-MESSAGE           PIC X(80).

      *================================================================
      *===           P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N
      *================================================================
       PROCEDURE DIVISION  USING LS-NEXT-PO-NUMBER
                                 LS-ERROR-MESSAGE.
       0000-PROGRAM-ENTRY.

           OPEN  I-O    PLANT-INFO-FILE
                 INPUT  MPORCV-FILE.

           PERFORM 0010-INITIALIZE      THRU 0010-EXIT.

           IF  FS-GOOD-FILE-IO
               PERFORM 1000-MAIN-LOGIC-RTN  THRU 1000-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 0099-END-OF-JOB      THRU 0099-EXIT.

           CLOSE        PLANT-INFO-FILE
                        MPORCV-FILE.

       0000-PROGRAM-END.
           GOBACK.

      *****************************************************************
      ** 1ST TIME PROCESSING ROUTINE
      *****************************************************************
       0010-INITIALIZE.

           MOVE ZERO           TO LS-NEXT-PO-NUMBER.

      *================================================================
      *== RETRIEVE LAST PO NUMBER USED FROM PLANT INFO FILE WHERE THE
      *== RECORD KEY = 'ARPO'.  UPDATE LATER WITH NEW LAST NUMBER
      *================================================================
           PERFORM 9000-READK-PLANT-INFO THRU 9000-READK-EXIT.
           IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
              MOVE  WS-PLTNOF-MSG    TO LS-ERROR-MESSAGE
           END-IF.

       0010-EXIT.
            EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      ** END OF JOB PROCESSING
      *****************************************************************
       0099-END-OF-JOB.

           IF  LS-ERROR-MESSAGE = SPACE
               MOVE WS-NEW-PO-NUMBER  TO LS-NEXT-PO-NUMBER
           ELSE
               MOVE WS-PO-NUMBER-A    TO WS-NEW-PO-NUM
               MOVE WS-NEW-PO-NUMBER  TO LS-NEXT-PO-NUMBER
           END-IF.

       0099-EXIT.
            EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      ***  MAIN PROCESSING LOOP ROUTINE
      *****************************************************************
       1000-MAIN-LOGIC-RTN.

      *================================================================
      *== PROCESS 2 NUMERIC PATTERNS - ALL ELSE IS AN ERROR
      *==        PATTERN #1 = XX99999 WHERE X = ANY ALPHA CHARACTER
      *==        PATTERN #2 = X999999 WHERE X = ANY ALPHA CHARACTERS
      *================================================================
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARIBA-CSISPOX-NUMX  TO WS-PO-NUMBER-A.

      *================================================================
      ***  ERROR !!
      ***  ALL 7 CHARACTERS ARE NUMERIC - 9999999 - ERROR
           IF  WS-PO-NUMBER-A IS NUMERIC
                PERFORM 1100-ALL-SEVEN-NUMERIC    THRU 1100-EXIT
                GO TO 1000-EXIT
           END-IF.

      *================================================================
      ***  PATTERN #1
      ***  ONLY 5 CHARACTERS ARE NUMERIC - XX99999
           IF  WS-PO-N1A IS NOT NUMERIC
           AND WS-PO-N2A IS NOT NUMERIC
                PERFORM 1300-ONLY-FIVE-NUMERIC    THRU 1300-EXIT
                GO TO 1000-EXIT
           END-IF.

      *================================================================
      ***  PATTERN #2
      ***  ONLY 6 CHARACTERS ARE NUMERIC - X999999
           IF  WS-PO-N1A IS NOT NUMERIC
               IF  WS-PO-N2A IS NUMERIC
                   PERFORM 1200-ONLY-SIX-NUMERIC     THRU 1200-EXIT
                   GO TO 1000-EXIT
               END-IF
           END-IF.

      *================================================================
      ***  E R R O R !!!
           MOVE  WS-INVALID-MSG1 TO LS-ERROR-MESSAGE.

       1000-EXIT.
            EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
      ***  ALL SEVEN CHARACTERS ARE NUMERIC   ==>  9999999
      *****************************************************************
       1100-ALL-SEVEN-NUMERIC.

           MOVE  WS-INVALID-MSG1 TO LS-ERROR-MESSAGE.

       1100-EXIT.
            EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
      ***  ONLY SIX CHARACTERS ARE NUMERIC   ==>  X999999
      *****************************************************************
       1200-ONLY-SIX-NUMERIC.

           IF  WS-PO-N2-7A   IS NOT NUMERIC
               MOVE  WS-INVALID-MSG1 TO LS-ERROR-MESSAGE
               GO TO 1200-EXIT
           END-IF.

      *================================================================
      *== INCREMENT LAST PO NUMBER FROM PLANT INFO AND USE IT AS KEY
      *== READ MPORCV - REPEAT UNTIL FILE STATUS "NOT FOUND"
      *================================================================
       1200-LOOP.

           ADD  1           TO WS-PO-N2-7N.
           MOVE WS-PO-NUMBER-A TO WS-NEW-PO-NUM.
           PERFORM 9100-READK-MPORCV     THRU 9100-READK-EXIT.
           IF FS-GOOD-FILE-IO
               GO TO 1200-LOOP
           END-IF.
           PERFORM 9000-REWRITE-PLANT-INFO THRU 9000-REWRITE-EXIT.

       1200-EXIT.
            EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      ***  ONLY FIVE CHARACTERS ARE NUMERIC   ==>  XX99999
      *****************************************************************
       1300-ONLY-FIVE-NUMERIC.

           IF  WS-PO-N3-7A   IS NOT NUMERIC
               MOVE  WS-INVALID-MSG1 TO LS-ERROR-MESSAGE
               GO TO 1300-EXIT
           END-IF.

      *================================================================
      *== INCREMENT LAST PO NUMBER FROM PLANT INFO AND USE IT AS KEY
      *== READ MPORCV - REPEAT UNTIL FILE STATUS "NOT FOUND"
      *================================================================
       1300-LOOP.

           ADD  1           TO WS-PO-N3-7N.
           MOVE WS-PO-NUMBER-A TO WS-NEW-PO-NUM.
           PERFORM 9100-READK-MPORCV     THRU 9100-READK-EXIT.
           IF FS-GOOD-FILE-IO
               GO TO 1300-LOOP
           END-IF.
           PERFORM 9000-REWRITE-PLANT-INFO THRU 9000-REWRITE-EXIT.

       1300-EXIT.
            EXIT.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      ***              ALL FILE I-O'S BELOW THIS POINT
      *----------------------------------------------------------------


      *****************************************************************
      ***  READ BY KEY PLANT INFO FILE
      *****************************************************************
       9000-READK-PLANT-INFO.

           INITIALIZE PLANT-INFO-REC.
           MOVE  WS-PLTINFO-KEY   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.

           READ PLANT-INFO-FILE
           END-READ.

       9000-READK-EXIT.
            EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
      *** READ PLANT INFO FILE TO LOCK DB RECORD FOR UPDATE
      *** REWRITE RECORD WITH NEW PO NUMBER
      *****************************************************************
       9000-REWRITE-PLANT-INFO.

           MOVE  WS-NEW-PO-NUM    TO MPLTINFO-ARIBA-CSISPOX-NUMX.

           REWRITE PLANT-INFO-REC
           END-REWRITE.

       9000-REWRITE-EXIT.
            EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
      ***  READ BY KEY MPORCV FILE
      *****************************************************************
       9100-READK-MPORCV.

           INITIALIZE MPORCV-REC.
           MOVE  WS-NEW-PO-NUMBER   TO M-PO-RCV-NO.

           READ MPORCV-FILE
           END-READ.

       9100-READK-EXIT.
            EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
      ***              END  OF  SOURCE  MEMBER
      *****************************************************************
